370
00:24:55,610 --> 00:25:01,470
and she had extrapulmonary
TB and not a lymphoma.

371
00:25:03,890 --> 00:25:07,230
Healthcare workers
should always supervise

372
00:25:07,230 --> 00:25:09,510
the patient when the
sputum is collected,

373
00:25:09,550 --> 00:25:12,610
since patients are
not always successful

374
00:25:12,610 --> 00:25:14,770
